{"root":"toreh","ipa":"/to.rɛh/","core":"划痕、刻痕、切割","pos":["动词","名词"],"scenes":["生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/to.rɛh/","zh":"划痕，刻痕，割痕","phrases":[{"t":"toreh luka","zh":"留下伤痕"},{"t":"toreh di kulit","zh":"在皮肤上划痕"},{"t":"toreh sejarah","zh":"创造历史（比喻）"}],"examples":[{"t":"Pisau itu meninggalkan toreh di kayu.","zh":"那把刀在木头上留下了刻痕。"},{"t":"Dia mencoba menghapus toreh itu.","zh":"他试图抹去那道划痕。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"toreh","ipa":"/to.rɛh/","zh":"划，刻","phrase":{"t":"toreh getah","zh":"割橡胶"},"example":{"t":"Petani itu mulai toreh getah pagi-pagi.","zh":"那个农民一大早就开始割橡胶。"}},{"w":"menoreh","ipa":"/mə.no.rɛh/","zh":"切割，割破，刻下","phrase":{"t":"menoreh prestasi","zh":"取得成就"},"example":{"t":"Atlet itu berhasil menoreh prestasi gemilang.","zh":"那位运动员成功取得了辉煌的成就。"}},{"w":"menorehkan","ipa":"/mə.no.rɛh.kan/","zh":"为...划刻，使留下","phrase":{"t":"menorehkan tinta","zh":"书写，留下笔墨"},"example":{"t":"Dia menorehkan namanya di hati rakyat.","zh":"他把自己的名字刻在了人民的心中。"}},{"w":"torehan","ipa":"/to.rɛh.an/","zh":"划痕，刻痕，成果","phrase":{"t":"torehan emas","zh":"金牌记录，辉煌战绩"},"example":{"t":"Torehan lukanya sangat dalam.","zh":"他的伤口划痕很深。"}},{"w":"penoreh","ipa":"/pə.no.rɛh/","zh":"割胶工，刻划者","phrase":{"t":"penoreh getah","zh":"割胶工人"},"example":{"t":"Ayahnya bekerja sebagai penoreh getah.","zh":"他的父亲是一名割胶工人。"}},{"w":"penorehan","ipa":"/pə.no.rɛh.an/","zh":"切割过程，刻划行为","phrase":{"t":"penorehan kayu","zh":"木材切割"},"example":{"t":"Proses penorehan itu memerlukan keahlian.","zh":"那个切割过程需要专业技能。"}}],"derSlugs":["toreh","menoreh","menorehkan","torehan","penoreh","penorehan"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T17:39:38.113Z","src":"base"}